Registered the control panel. The **Identity providers** entry now exists in `portal_controlpanel` and is served by `@controlpanels/identity-providers`, so Plone's own control panel listing links to the panel the frontend renders at `/controlpanel/identity-providers` instead of leaving it reachable only by typing the URL; uninstalling removes it again. The settings behind it are described by an `IIdentitySettings` schema, and the GenericSetup profile imports that schema rather than declaring each record's field by hand, so a record is documented in exactly one place. Record names are unchanged. @ericof
